{"name":"Empower","hex":"#b54644","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"empower","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To give permission, power, or the legal right to do something.","To give someone more confidence and/or strength to do something, often by enabling them to increase their control over their own life or situation."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/empower"}],"entries":[{"title":"EMPOWER","blocks":[{"text":"EMPOWER, also known as Centre for Sex Workers' Protection or Moolniti Songserm Okard Pooying, is a non-profit organization in Thailand that supports sex workers by offering free classes in language, health, law and pre-college education, as well as individual counselling. The organization also lobbies the government to extend regular labor protections to sex workers and to decriminalize sex work. The organization maintains centres in Patpong (Bangkok), Chiang Mai, Mae Sai and Patong, Phuket."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EMPOWER"},{"title":"Empower (agency)","blocks":[{"text":"Empower is an advertising and marketing agency headquartered in Chicago, IL, founded in Cincinnati in 1985 by Mary Beth Price. The agency was acquired in 2023 by CEO Ashlee Clarke."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/64/Empower_Logo_as_of_Oct_11%2C_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Empower_(agency)"},{"title":"Empower (financial services)","blocks":[{"text":"Empower Annuity Insurance Company of America is a retirement plan recordkeeping financial holding company based in Greenwood Village, Colorado, United States. It is the second-largest retirement plan provider in the United States."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Great-West_Life_U.S._HQ.jpg/330px-Great-West_Life_U.S._HQ.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wi